config BR2_PACKAGE_RKNPU_DRIVER
	bool "rknpu-driver"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  Vendor RKNPU kernel driver (v0.9.8, Rockchip 6.1 BSP) built
	  out-of-tree against the mainline kernel, ported with a small
	  patch series. Provides /dev/dri render node ioctls for the
	  librknnrt runtime. Devfreq/OPP integration is compiled out;
	  the NPU runs at a fixed clock without an IOMMU (CMA buffers).

	  https://github.com/armbian/linux-rockchip
